&_nc_oc=AdoYmW2eu6u62ZClPDUXuUCBwUGp3P64PnWnfCqowauFMHuFoYQKm_J_JsY_RDJarXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af18NhzDGQhS5EQsPJQPxezuPQ8xXbCQMwBazFB0ECfqsQ&oe=69DE21FE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eqlyM8-kZlwQ7kNvwHfKfnS&_nc_oc=AdpgIl0JScnnHm3wkbJfCWlFvbJMIEULKJ4CvUuaHjMQuc8cDYSIND7vwlF366L2T90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2zV_GtLtHZ-Rmw8RFvZBhKPnf-sN-gJZt4V82PiPYUVQ&oe=69DE32FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q-sFRIYBqtQQ7kNvwGGxjwr&_nc_oc=Adpr_nbjFNOn_HcMXrYDUIjTwaUJKzKsJQ7m2ow-fnf7NmOgdlr77VxtNfNrG5QgCfw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3VHx_7kfJ55UcFA5aauro0p33ROW3VlqBSaY_5GnRGRw&oe=69DE5187"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wZRM3cddOSEQ7kNvwGiv68J&_nc_oc=Adr4ozmhPbqpScPDpSYV6mkrfb3-TkMgcDR6SC8KCL-RvjLJ7tqRl1hCL_-tOmCGMd4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af15WqU_P9-fRluvuXYiVDyqRxurnJaR5tvE3l9zjir_5w&oe=69DE3D55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vE9mFm8t4f0Q7kNvwG5W-mh&_nc_oc=Ado-qdCazA5fqlNOWQ2XDxAF2DWhz-CU1U2YM8tKw6ZL6ebUh7dmsYhcMd5qixhYl7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1-LCAXRVgUZ6M2__Q3eL9ZIchsvJlEwcxZ0splzsJhQQ&oe=69DE49E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.